From 59599229adb77a5c3e9a015ec77fbccf3d91f9ac Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jesus David Saavedra Latorre <iam.jesusd88@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 9 Oct 2026 21:37:22 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 02/26] feat(digitizer): send 16-bit swipe keycodes and add mac
 keymap

Swipe gestures used tap_code(), which truncates modded keycodes such as
C(KC_RIGHT). Use tap_code16() so swipes can send macOS shortcuts.
Defaults are unchanged.

Add a VIA-enabled mac keymap for the Dilemma Max (Procyon) that maps
3-finger swipes to Ctrl+arrows like the native macOS trackpad.
